  "releaseNotes": "First preview. SkiaCalendarView, SkiaToggleButton, SkiaComboBox, SkiaSelectorView and SkiaGalleryView (swipeable images with page indicators; inside SkiaCollectionView item templates it is baked with the row and comes alive under the finger). Requires SkiaCollectionView 2.0.0-rc.2, .NET 11 / MAUI 11 RC2.",
